863
01:23:21.160 --> 01:23:22.241
I'm not going anywhere.

864
01:23:22.600 --> 01:23:23.600
I'm staying.

865
01:23:26.720 --> 01:23:28.085
Me, too.

866
01:23:32.480 --> 01:23:33.720
Me, too.

867
01:23:37.480 --> 01:23:38.641
Hu Bayi!

868
01:23:40.680 --> 01:23:42.920
