955
01:40:43.280 --> 01:40:44.850
Fatty!

956
01:41:51.200 --> 01:41:52.200
Don't be afraid.

957
01:41:52.680 --> 01:41:54.336
You'll be 0k.

958
01:41:54.360 --> 01:41:56.249
Go back with me.

959
